Exercise 10 - Identifying High-Paying Data Analyst Jobs

Business Problem:
The recruiting manager noticed that some Data Analyst job postings 
offer significantly higher salaries than expected. To review the hiring 
budget, identify all Data Analyst positions with an average annual salary of at least $100,000.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SELECT job_id,
       job_title_short,
       salary_year_avg,
       job_location,
       CASE
           WHEN salary_year_avg >= 100000 THEN 'Salary_Above_The_AVG'
           ELSE 'Unkown'
       END AS High_Salary
FROM job_postings_fact
WHERE salary_year_avg >= 100000
  AND job_title_short = 'Data Analyst'
ORDER BY salary_year_avg DESC;
